{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "WhereWild Standard Voyager",
  "metadata": {
    "ww:note": "Fork of CARTO Voyager (github.com/CartoDB/basemap-styles/blob/master/mapboxgl/voyager.json) \u2014 same BSD-3-Clause/CC-BY 4.0 license as Positron/Dark Matter, same required attribution (CARTO + OpenMapTiles + OpenStreetMap). Demo/preview style, not currently wired into build_basemap_tiles.py's BASE_STYLES \u2014 proves theme-swapping is just another style.json against the same PMTiles data, no rebuild. Extra landcover classes (grass/scrub/wetland/ice/sand/rock), ferry, and mountain-peak are WhereWild additions with no CARTO equivalent, same idiom as standard-light/dark."
  },
  "glyphs": "{fontstack}/{range}.pbf",
  "sources": {
    "openmaptiles": {
      "type": "vector",
      "url": "mbtiles://{openmaptiles}"
    }
  },
